<title>USA: Countrywide Oct mortgage loan fundings down.</title>
<headline>Countrywide Oct mortgage loan fundings down.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Countrywide Credit Industries Inc said Tuesday that it funded $2.8 billion of mortgage loans in October, 12 percent lower than the $3.3 billion funded in October 1995.</p>
<p>The company said its loans in process totaled $4.4 billion at October 31, compared to $4.8 billion at October 31, 1995.</p>
